  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the human man (man) sitting in the grass with a toy fishing rod, as the meme's humor and comparison are centered on this human figure. The text 'after 3 million years of evolution' implies the user (as a human) is part of the evolutionary narrative being referenced, and the comparison to the gorilla is framed as a shared, universal human trait (relaxation) that the user can identify with. The user is implicitly 'me' or 'you' in the context of the meme's ironic statement.",
